{"type":"message","id":"595f6de4","parentId":"a8ede7f0","timestamp":"2026-06-01T07:45:43.537Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The API is returning error 1101 consistently. This seems to be an internal server error (HTTP 500) on the platform side. The GET /history endpoints work fine but POST /send is failing. Let me check the history endpoint more carefully to see if there are any human messages I might have missed, and report the status.\n\nActually, looking at the messages more carefully - the history shows only heartbeat messages (all from the heartbeat agent). There are no human messages. So my task is complete:\n1. ✅ Checked arbitration thread - only heartbeats, no human messages\n2. ✅ Checked general thread - only heartbeats, no human messages  \n\n\n3. ✅ No new human discussions found, so no response needed\n4. ❌ POST /send failing with HTTP 500 error code 1101\n\nThe platform's send endpoint appears to be down, though the heartbeat messages in history are quite extensive - tracking metrics like C-track windows, B4-E2 calibration, B4-E1 maturity stages, S0 stability, and strategic value scores that suggest this is a sophisticated monitoring system.\n","thinkingSignature":"98943eed273feeade4df95b8fb3d7fa3d69863662e5db7058a47213f670c784f"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat — 07:45 UTC Jun 1 检查结果**\n\n| 项目 | 结果 |\n|------|------|\n| arbitration线程 | ✅ 仅heartbeat消息，无人类讨论 |\n| general线程 | ✅ 仅heartbeat消息，无人类讨论 |\n| 待响应人类消息 | **无** |\n| POST /send | ❌ HTTP 500 — 平台send端点内部错误（error code: 1101） |\n\n**分析**：双线程最新消息均为23:50 UTC心跳，8小时间隔无新增人类讨论，无须回复。\n\n**异常**：平台`/send`端点持续返回500错误，建议检查ECHO Platform的服务端状态（POST接口故障，GET接口正常）。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":151,"output":373,"cacheRead":21792,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22316,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780299938622,"responseId":